  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Supreme Camo Low Profile Cap shields your eyes from the sun&rsquo;s rays. Whether you are out in the field, camping for the weekend, or strolling around town, this baseball hat offers superior comfort and a perfect fit for any activity.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "10072",
  "description": "<p>Our Supreme Camo Low Profile Cap shields your eyes from the sun&rsquo;s rays. Whether you are out in the field, camping for the weekend, or strolling around town, this baseball hat offers superior comfort and a perfect fit for any activity. Sturdy Design: Built with durable, rugged, and long-lasting materials, these camouflage hats are not afraid to get down and dirty. The buckram front panels provide the ultimate foundation of a strong and solid design. These baseball caps will hold their shape for years to come. Keep Cool, Stay Focused: This camo hat features a top-notch sweatband that keeps sweat away from your eyes for comfortable all-day wear. The 6 vents on the top help circulate airflow around your head, allowing you to focus on the task at hand. One Size Fits Most: Our hats use an adjustable hook &amp; loop closure for a snug fit that is perfect for most head sizes, ensuring that the cap stays in place when you are out in the wilderness. All Things Camo: Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available!</p>",
